ControlCodes
============

While Phoenix is running these control codes can be used (Anywhere):

Format:
   %<Number>[:Args][%Format]|

CC   | Description                                  | Arg    | Output
=====+==============================================+========+=========
     | MAIN                                         |        |
=====+==============================================+========+=========
3100 | Version information/Copyright message        | N/A    | String
=====+==============================================+========+=========
     | USER                                         |        |
=====+==============================================+========+=========
3110 | Charset number                               |        | 
3111 | Charset name                                 |        | 
3112 | Archiver number                              |        | 
3113 | Archiver name                                |        | 
3114 | Packet type number                           |        | 
3115 | Packet type name (QWK, Bluewave etc)         |        | 
3116 | Max messages/packet                          |        | 
3117 | Max messages/area                            |        | 
-----+----------------------------------------------+--------+---------
     | Flags                                        |        |
-----+----------------------------------------------+--------+---------
3120 | User wants news file                         |        | 
3121 | User wants hello file                        |        | 
3122 | User wants goodbye file                      |        | 
3123 | User wants filelist                          |        | 
3124 | Do not Include index files (QWK *.NDX)       |        | 
3125 | Do not convert messages (Charsets)           |        | 
3126 | Do not include messages from user            |        | 
3127 | Dump all new messages (Not last x)           |        | 
=====+==============================================+========+=========
     | AREAS                                        |        |
=====+==============================================+========+=========
3130 | Area is masked                               |        | 
317  | Only dump personal messages                  |        | 
     |                                              |        | 
-----+----------------------------------------------+--------+---------
